  "description": "The hero who defeated the Demon King and saved the world is summoned to a school full of bullies?!\n\nAn interdimensional hero is summoned to “Suseong Nam-bu High School,” a hotbed of the worst kind of delinquents. Though the hero never uses his powers against humans, upon facing the “demon-like” reality of these bullies, he decides to teach them a lesson they won’t forget…!\n\nWill the hero be able to defeat the bullies and return to his own world?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
